# This directory is its own repository (since 2026-08-16), separate from the
# outer one at /var/www/html/themeaves that holds _dev, docs, brand and shots.
# The outer repository now sees site/ as an embedded repo and no longer tracks
# its contents; commit here, and the user runs every git operation.
